    "sections": {
        "description": "ST Solar Energy is a modern and performance-focused WordPress theme created for solar companies, renewable energy providers, Solar installers, energy company, green energy, industry, power company, renewable energy, solar panels sellers, wind energy company, and eco-friendly businesses. With its clean, high-contrast design and bold typography, the theme helps you showcase services such as solar panel installation, energy solutions, maintenance, and commercial projects with professionalism and clarity. It includes professionally designed sections that make it easy to present your offerings, build customer trust, and generate valuable leads. The theme features a fully responsive layout, ensuring a smooth and consistent browsing experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices while maintaining a premium and conversion-focused appearance. Whether you are building a website for a local solar installer or a large renewable energy company, ST Solar Energy provides a dependable, scalable, and professional foundation for establishing a strong online presence."
    },
